+## Amended in session 15c
+
+**A proposal left unanswered ends `superseded`**, the seventh ending, written
+when it is left: a new ask over it (the new run follows it in its negotiation,
+as after `stopped`), or the report of the workout an adaptation adapts. Like
+`stopped`, it happens at a known moment, so it is an ending and not *cut*.
+
 ## Consequences
 
 - **`record.Run` goes.** The model, provider and budget carried in the run's config were the identity of a run answered by one model; the model belongs to the node that did the work and goes in the record's node entries.
